# Heavy and third-party media stays OUT of git (git keeps every binary version forever, and the repo may be public).
# Everything ignored here is listed in docs/MEDIA.md (size, duration, sha256): python tools/media_manifest.py

# --- finished renders / deliverables (share via Drive or similar) ---
outputs/*
!outputs/.gitkeep
projects/*/renders/

# --- client material inside projects (voice-overs, logos, footage): keep locally, list in MEDIA.md ---
projects/*/assets/*.mp3
projects/*/assets/*.wav
projects/*/assets/*.m4a
projects/*/assets/*.mp4
projects/*/assets/*.mov
*.tmp.wav

# --- third-party reference videos and temporary analysis frames ---
refrences/**/*.mp4
refrences/**/*.webm
refrences/**/*.info.json
refrences/**/frames/
refrences/**/sheets/

# --- HyperFrames local state, snapshots, check reports ---
**/.hyperframes/

# --- tooling noise ---
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
